Implementation notes:

- BiliDigest is a Python CLI and Agent Skill for summarizing and organizing videos from the user's own logged-in Bilibili Watch Later and Favorites lists.
- The project intentionally keeps a small local CLI surface and does not include BiliTools' Tauri/Vue/Rust desktop UI.
- Parts of the implementation strategy, API boundaries, login/session handling, risk-control behavior, and safety defaults were informed by reading the open-source BiliTools project:
  https://github.com/btjawa/BiliTools
- BiliTools is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later. Redistribution of BiliDigest should preserve this notice and the GPL-3.0-or-later license terms.
